{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0383_1000_p", "source_sha256": "099b16a81a6d9658fe97f07ad975eb84af146290c0a12fb09887d69bb60af5c0", "ja": "（ジュリアと恵美のデュオ公演は、大歓声のうちに幕を\n下ろした。いやぁ……すごい盛り上がりだったな！）", "zh": "（茱莉亚和惠美的双人公演在一片欢呼声中落下了帷幕。哎呀……气氛真是太热烈了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0383_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "5e4521bebc5b9e5be07b04f88c242fd6d646c9f73c264be9e9e6f7652090174c", "ja": "くぅ～、やっぱりライブは最高だぜ……！\n{$P$}、どうだった？", "zh": "呜～，现场演出果然最棒了……！\n{$P$}，感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0383_1002_p", "source_sha256": "dfc27f7f4db1f3abd6f1be14ea15c25152ef7580a9ed287f4473fff2b1f64c3b", "ja": "ジュリア、お疲れ様！\nもちろん、最高だった！　見ていて元気になったよ！", "zh": "茱莉亚，辛苦了！\n当然，太棒了！看着你，我也打起精神来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0383_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "551af51d67ff9318fce67983d1185643b9aeb2e8151c17e07e75b649dfa2f23f", "ja": "そうみたいだな。レッスン期間中は元気なかったのに、\nすっかり元通り……いや、ちょっと戻りすぎかな？", "zh": "看来确实是这样。明明在训练期间还没什么精神，\n现在已经完全恢复了……不，或许是恢复过头了点？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0383_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a22eb8d350387f5a36179a88c1487221ba64afb5953a27cfa74f26e19dc63dbf", "ja": "そりゃ、あんなステージ見せられたらな！\n想像以上のデュオになってて、驚いたよ。", "zh": "那当然了，看到那样的舞台，谁都会这样啊！\n没想到你们成了远超想象的二重唱，真让我吃了一惊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0383_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "147cff25e771b67c6688ce2020ee019e08ce2ffdb4065e6571a811bf9112e1c2", "ja": "ああ、あたしも驚いたよ。\n声の相性もバッチリだし、メチャクチャ楽しめたよ。", "zh": "啊，我也吓了一跳。\n声音的契合度也刚刚好，真的特别开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0383_1006_p", "source_sha256": "683f410c0a78edd5a75e1a8fc2aae2a3d1d20b31d22a0e251f19efdee45868b1", "ja": "なによりだ。\n今回は本当に、ふたりに任せてよかったよ。", "zh": "最重要的是。\n这次真的很庆幸把这件事交给你们两个人了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0383_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "2ce8d5d24a100a29616d6dce859d2b810afe4336d44720bd69eec6e818ca2998", "ja": "手が掛からなくて助かった、って？", "zh": "你的意思是说，没费什么心就帮大忙了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0383_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a32f8e2779299bde3c328876375d90ca4c5be7ce5f4f87667d57c87ee0ca388d", "ja": "い、いや、それは……！\nそうだけど、それだけじゃないからな？", "zh": "不、不是……！\n虽然是这样，但可不只是因为这个啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0383_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "491f060ed534cdf3a06d0b30bba5dc907d4950deac21009cb806640ea64a074f", "ja": "ははっ、わかってるって！　ジョークだよ。\nま、あんたが居なくたってうまくやるけどさ……。", "zh": "哈哈，我知道啦！开玩笑的。\n不过嘛，就算没有你我也能做好的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0383_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "786e7e63f2d55fae4f2e99087a4f8c2f05a68655cc4c47dae503742f30ff4548", "ja": "でもやっぱり、ダンスが初めてハマった瞬間とか、\n歌の完成形が見えたときの高揚感とか……。", "zh": "不过说到底，舞蹈第一次找到感觉的瞬间，或是看见歌曲完成形态时的兴奋感……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0383_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "597c85f4bc5441975cf5cfdcf473ceb88c4441e66e1efa1cbcee54b1f3156cdc", "ja": "そういうの、一緒に感じたくないか？\nアイドルとプロデューサーなんだから。", "zh": "那种感觉，不想一起感受吗？\n毕竟我们是偶像和制作人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0383_1012_p", "source_sha256": "a3c73d02292566ff48291fd59b309f818c5020dababd5e1e35d209f7c55096cc", "ja": "ジュリア……そうだな、ゴメン。\n次はしっかり、時間を空けられるようにするよ。", "zh": "茱莉亚……嗯，说得也是，抱歉。\n下次我会好好留出时间的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0383_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "bcc42c3b82ae7dfe0c111a85abbc9d4ddaf63b4ae5b25b7316bf9c9ea22ff2fa", "ja": "いや、まあ……別に責めてんじゃないからな？\n無理して欲しいわけじゃないし。", "zh": "哎，那个……我也不是在责怪你啦？\n又不是想让你勉强自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0383_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "144941cc467082eaa2f439fb7d07337838f2e87ede72d43d247b88ddb3783eef", "ja": "ただ……少しくらいあたしも、\nワガママ言ってやろうかな、って……思っただけ。", "zh": "只是……我也想稍微任性一下，提点要求……仅此而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0383_1015_p", "source_sha256": "47ed6d7a681a9980004ae5b599d2436d803782cb4fe40939a3daab38755c120a", "ja": "ワガママ、か……わかった。\n何でも言ってくれ。今回のお礼に聞くから。", "zh": "任性吗……我明白了。\n你尽管说吧。就当作这次的答谢，我都会听的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0383_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "532bcacad44c4e77594b9e6a4727236440b9313797e2560695d3d1a8cb70b0a0", "ja": "お、言ったな{$P$}？\nその言葉、ちゃーんと覚えとけよ♪", "zh": "哦，是你说的啊，{$P$}？\n这句话可要好好记住哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0383_1017_p", "source_sha256": "0a1498ff841c295c988e7f4956540739376cdfc057f5524d6f784e1378e6fdf3", "ja": "ああ、もちろんだ！", "zh": "好，当然没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0383_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "01179c41d32d04ac1219c4dfedd624fd54e946b90e5651401edc04a68b071b1c", "ja": "よーし！　んじゃ、何がいいか、恵美と相談するよ。\nステーキか、寿司か……しゃぶしゃぶ……？", "zh": "好——！那我这就去和惠美商量一下吃什么。\n牛排、寿司……还是涮涮锅呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
